# Overview

提供用于收发第三方应用自定义的消息或文件相关的类和接口。

## Interface Summary

|Interface|Description|
|:-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:-------------|
|[PingCallback](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/pingcallback-0000001058995433)|发送Ping消息的回调接口。|
|[Receiver](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/receiver-0000001059027011)|接收消息监测接口。|
|[SendCallback](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/sendcallback-0000001059147015)|发送消息的回调接口。|

## Class Summary

|Class|Description|
|:-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:------------|
|[HiWearMessage](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/hiwearmessage-0000001059835462)|发送给手机端的消息对象。|
|[HiWearMessage.Builder](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/hiwearmessage_builder-0000001058609353)|Message内部创建类。|
|[P2pClient](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/p2pclient-0000001059995062)|用于点对点通信的客户端。|

